    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Griffon is a type of dog - a collection of breeds that were originally hunting dogs. There are three lines of the griffon type recognized by the Fédération Cynologique Internationale (FCI): the griffon vendéens, the wirehaired pointers, and the \"smousje\" (Belgian companion dogs or Dutch Smoushond). The griffon type is characterized by rough or wire-hair.",
